# AI Music Editor - Environment Configuration

## Model Backend
# Options: browser | local | deapi
MODEL_BACKEND=browser

## Local Service Endpoints (when MODEL_BACKEND=local)
LOCAL_MUSIC_URL=http://localhost:8787/music
LOCAL_ASR_URL=http://localhost:8788/asr
LOCAL_TTS_URL=http://localhost:8789/tts
LOCAL_OCR_URL=http://localhost:8790/ocr

## DeAPI Configuration (when MODEL_BACKEND=deapi)
DEAPI_BASE_URL=https://api.deapi.ai/api/v1
DEAPI_MUSIC_MODEL=ace-step-1.5
DEAPI_KEY=
